            <description><![CDATA[<h2>VoiceClaw Companion 0.1.69</h2><ul><li>Fixes GPT-Realtime-2 OAuth via the Companion for newer OpenClaw OAuth profile stores, including OpenClaw / Hermes routes paired by QR settings sync.</li><li>Allows paired iPhone and Apple Watch sessions to use ChatGPT subscription authentication through the Companion without also requiring an in-app ChatGPT sign-in on the phone.</li><li>Preserves compatibility with older OpenClaw provider-auth installs and existing OpenAI API key fallback behavior.</li></ul>
]]></description>
