            <description><![CDATA[<h2>VoiceClaw Companion 0.1.68</h2><ul><li>Fixes GPT-Realtime-2 OAuth signaling for paired phones signed in with ChatGPT by accepting phone-minted client secrets before falling back to local OpenClaw OAuth.</li><li>Clarifies Hermes Agent support throughout setup, pairing, auth, and diagnostics.</li><li>Explains why Hermes routes do not require a Hermes install path in the Companion.</li></ul>
]]></description>
